{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）早上8時13分，警方接獲途人報案，指慈雲山慈愛苑愛榮閣對上晨運徑有人在樹上自縊。救援人員到場將該名30餘歲的男子解下，經檢驗證實當場不治。</p><p>警方正調查事主身份及事件經過。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防將事主解下，證實當場不治。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163790224023621632039512.jpeg/7-aF7RFdrUsBG-WaCLYur9tWIcDJIfqLJJIoBw6SKAc\"/><figcaption>消防將事主解下，證實當場不治。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"山邊發現一名男子在樹上自縊。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163778920756023296094532.jpeg/9AcsNztMnxuD6VruALoRRpVxuxIialiMQqktR2ipLUc\"/><figcaption>山邊發現一名男子在樹上自縊。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈愛苑愛榮閣對上晨運徑一名30多歲男子在樹上自縊。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163779824691449856639847.jpeg/cpHQ0gKUBPZX7hsXxLCeMjlIBjeKT1TLjOHyBqbh8gY\"/><figcaption>慈愛苑愛榮閣對上晨運徑一名30多歲男子在樹上自縊。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員上山尋找事主。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163779955302076416839276.jpeg/nwjGl2AFmJRm97LmRMJQO5CCHZeg4RtwMIxGuBqMRrg\"/><figcaption>救援人員上山尋找事主。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被發現在樹上自縊，當場不治。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163779961132421120938167.jpeg/AcQaNFAJr5Y2YSfQfFIuQ4qSPkVYK4ujrv1o2IT9aNg\"/><figcaption>事主被發現在樹上自縊，當場不治。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車在場戒備。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163778923671195648396180.jpeg/xqEs8xM0O2P8VNaa3wOM20O9jjFfm3lTgpWAMKiVgDA\"/><figcaption>救護車在場戒備。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方正調查事主身份。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260811/1163779958296940544186240.jpeg/aUkOcAoM8I0DewK1QgtiwpAfUog3KKHDhYe7Q6-Hu0M\"/><figcaption>警方正調查事主身份。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T02:20:23.881449+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}